                    <string key="text">Grab your photo ID. This can be a passport, driver’s license or any other government issued ID. Ensure the edges of your ID are in the frame and clearly visible. Hold it in your hand to avoid any glare. Pay attention to the live feedback. For some ID’s you may need to scan the back as well.</string>
